{"name":"Farm Fresh","hex":"#8e9b88","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"farm","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A place where agricultural and similar activities take place, especially the growing of crops or the raising of livestock.","A tract of land held on lease for the purpose of cultivation."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To work on a farm, especially in the growing and harvesting of crops.","To devote (land) to farming."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/farm"},{"term":"fresh","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Newly produced or obtained; recent.","(of food) Not dried, frozen, or spoiled."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["Recently; just recently; most recently."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/fresh"}],"entries":[{"title":"Farm Fresh Food & Pharmacy","blocks":[{"text":"Farm Fresh Food & Pharmacy is a supermarket chain with four independently owned stores, all of which are in Virginia. At its peak, Farm Fresh called itself \"Virginia's Grocery Store\" because it had stores spanning the state. Its headquarters were located in Virginia Beach and its largest presence was in the surrounding Norfolk/Virginia Beach metropolitan area. The company was a wholly owned subsidiary of Eden Prairie, Minnesota-based SuperValu. On March 14, 2018, it was revealed that parent company, SuperValu, would be selling 21 stores to Kroger and Ahold Delhaize. Currently, three Farm Fresh stores remain in operation under different ownership."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/a4/Farmfresh_small.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Farm_Fresh_Food_%26_Pharmacy","wikidata":"Q5435496"},{"title":"Farm Fresh (company)","blocks":[{"text":"Farm Fresh Berhad is a Malaysian dairy products company based in Sedili, Johor. Founded in 2009 by Loi Tuan Eee, it has two factories operated in Bandar Muadzam Shah, Pahang and in Larkin, Johor where the factory's production capacity reaches 12 million liters per year with an estimated one million liters per month. Malaysian sovereign wealth fund, Khazanah Nasional through its wholly-owned subsidiary, Agrifood Resources was its substantial shareholder of Farm Fresh, but divested its shares in September 2025."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/a8/Farm_Fresh_logo.png/330px-Farm_Fresh_logo.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Farm_Fresh_(company)","wikidata":"Q85986130"},{"title":"Farm","blocks":[{"text":"A farm is an area of land that is devoted primarily to agricultural processes with the primary objective of producing food and other crops; it is the basic facility in food production. The name is used for specialized units such as arable farms, vegetable farms, fruit farms, dairy, pig and poultry farms, and land used for the production of natural fiber, biofuel, and other biobased products. It includes ranches, feedlots, orchards, plantations and estates, smallholdings, and hobby farms, and includes the farmhouse and agricultural buildings as well as the land. In modern times, the term has been extended to include such industrial operations as wind farms and fish farms, both of which can operate on land or at sea."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/Church_Farm%2C_Stockton%2C_Norfolk_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1968544.jpg/330px-Church_Farm%2C_Stockton%2C_Norfolk_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1968544.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Farm","wikidata":"Q131596"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/Farm_Fresh_Norge%2C_VA.jpg/500px-Farm_Fresh_Norge%2C_VA.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/Farm_Fresh_Norge%2C_VA.jpg/1280px-Farm_Fresh_Norge%2C_VA.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/Farm_Fresh_Norge%2C_VA.jpg/500px-Farm_Fresh_Norge%2C_VA.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Norge, Virginia Farm Fresh & Pharmacy store. This store closed in October 2019. ","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFarm_Fresh_Norge%2C_VA.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Plan_mediaeval_manor.jpg/500px-Plan_mediaeval_manor.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Plan_mediaeval_manor.jpg/1280px-Plan_mediaeval_manor.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Plan_mediaeval_manor.jpg/500px-Plan_mediaeval_manor.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Typical plan of a medieval English manor, showing the use of field strips","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APlan_mediaeval_manor.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Marion_Cty%2C_Iowa_Farmer_w_mule_drawn_wagon%2C_1920s.jpg/500px-Marion_Cty%2C_Iowa_Farmer_w_mule_drawn_wagon%2C_1920s.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Marion_Cty%2C_Iowa_Farmer_w_mule_drawn_wagon%2C_1920s.jpg/500px-Marion_Cty%2C_Iowa_Farmer_w_mule_drawn_wagon%2C_1920s.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A farmer harvesting crops with mule-drawn wagon, 1920s, Iowa, US","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMarion_Cty%2C_Iowa_Farmer_w_mule_drawn_wagon%2C_1920s.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/Dell_City%2C_Texas_%2829